### profiling skills — bundled analysis tooling ###
# The profiling skills (perf-sampling-parser / perf-optimizer / etl-generator)
# ship a prebuilt PerfView + TraceEvent toolset and a speedscope web bundle.
# Un-ignore the executables/libraries they need at runtime, but keep debug
# symbols (*.pdb) and per-run trace artifacts out of the repo.
!skills/profiling/**/*.exe
!skills/profiling/**/*.dll
!skills/profiling/**/*.wasm
!skills/profiling/**/*.a
!skills/profiling/**/*.lib
# never commit debug symbols or captured traces, even under profiling/
skills/profiling/**/*.pdb
skills/profiling/**/*.etl
skills/profiling/**/*.etlx
skills/profiling/**/temp/